{
  "work_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero",
  "source_path": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero.json",
  "source_language": "syc",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524",
      "source_sha256": "9c22610e994666d4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] of Saint Peter and King Nero."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s1",
      "source_sha256": "169347633e136ef8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I looked out over the troubled sea and saw twelve ships sailing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s2",
      "source_sha256": "958b6f4ed1b761b6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sea had risen against them, but he passed through it and calmed its waves."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s3",
      "source_sha256": "af2c4ff5cb53caef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He set the sea’s four winds in order, for their pilot was wise."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4d5f1f8a405514fd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "However much it rose and raged, they showed their victory."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s5",
      "source_sha256": "e3a1c99660f0d8f2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sea’s waves rose high, so that the ships might sink in them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s6",
      "source_sha256": "8cedf6cfb43ac755",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But they kept their course straight, reached the harbor, and rested. From here: salted provisions [?]; helps."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c4a0854033b23b78",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And let us all together, with one accord, offer glory to the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.1.s8",
      "source_sha256": "fb716251cf99d358",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "May his compassion overshadow our whole congregation, every one of us, now and at all times and forever and ever."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s1",
      "source_sha256": "ce4b60d4ca056f49",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They carried great wealth and distributed it without limit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s2",
      "source_sha256": "c675b306c7b0e56c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The king of the sea saw their wealth and stirred up the sea so that they would sink in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s3",
      "source_sha256": "5a0f0159cb19cc7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sea is this world, and the ships are the twelve apostles in it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s4",
      "source_sha256": "0f81e0d2ad4624d7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sea that rose against them is the world that rejected their teaching. I called the evil one the king of the sea:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s5",
      "source_sha256": "45bf2ad1b6b758ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the enemy of Jesus and his servants. I called the kingdom the harbor, for the apostles found rest within it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s6",
      "source_sha256": "1f0f44a68c664a87",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the enemy saw the apostles proclaiming the good news of the kingdom,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s7",
      "source_sha256": "da66b24e45b67810",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he led the judges of the world astray so that they would not accept their good news. He found himself an eager servant, Nero Caesar, and was pleased with him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s8",
      "source_sha256": "7dbeb5ec569fd483",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Through him he fulfilled his desire against two apostles, Simon Peter and Paul."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s9",
      "source_sha256": "96e406e73f9f3c19",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Paraclete, who comforts everyone, had sent Simon to Rome,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s10",
      "source_sha256": "03ec88489709a281",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "where Nero was reigning—a field that produced thorns."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s11",
      "source_sha256": "e302bdb7217328ea",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Paul, the herald of the nations, traveled to Rome to join his senior fellow worker [?]. Nero heard their teaching and armed himself for debate."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s12",
      "source_sha256": "56d6da5004d64ee0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero. Nero said to his servants, roused by his fury:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s13",
      "source_sha256": "f7a4e0c6ce2b07a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“What have you heard, my friends? That Galileans have come up to our city!” Servants."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s14",
      "source_sha256": "eef2d46acddfcc0f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“May you live forever, O king! The report you have heard is true. They are indeed going about in our city, teaching the Nazarene’s doctrine.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s15",
      "source_sha256": "419e7013369b1e4c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero. “In what guise do they appear, and what is their teaching,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s16",
      "source_sha256": "4aaa457d9423b0b2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that they dared to come and were not overcome by the gods who overcome everyone?” Servant."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.2.s17",
      "source_sha256": "e222b4ca9f11743e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Order, my lord the king, that they come here, and hear what they have to say, for there is no way of life like theirs."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s1",
      "source_sha256": "619d205bb284faac",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And their teaching is foreign to the world. Nero: A great calamity has come upon us! Perhaps our gods will be abolished,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s2",
      "source_sha256": "477b11d8695dc3fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and their temples too will be overthrown. What shall we do if this happens? Servants:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s3",
      "source_sha256": "7cf2b1f9830e2edc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is a great disgrace, as you have said, since all nations tremble before you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s4",
      "source_sha256": "81826c65143d337e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If two men defeat you, it is a great disgrace throughout the world!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s5",
      "source_sha256": "e3191d2dbf69abcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero: Go and bring them here to me, so that I may hear what they have to say."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s6",
      "source_sha256": "368c2f16b466d822",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For if they do not worship our gods, they shall be cut apart limb by limb. Servants:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s7",
      "source_sha256": "c0b1c59cd9c6dd8f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is our duty to obey you and bring the men you told us about."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s8",
      "source_sha256": "8b715b9dc29ea292",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They hurried off joyfully and brought them to stand before his throne. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s9",
      "source_sha256": "c158639ead830d1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Are these the men who have disturbed us and thrown mighty Rome into turmoil? Come forward and explain your teaching to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s10",
      "source_sha256": "47439774362e0e4f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And who sent you to come here? Simon: Look, O king, if you had learned from the teaching of the one who sent me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s11",
      "source_sha256": "8ba68dc1876fbd49",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you would not be ruling only on earth; in heaven too your throne would [?]. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s12",
      "source_sha256": "17f24f2b225d2f1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who is this who sent you, whose authority is greater than mine? If you are his envoy, the king you serve is contemptible."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s13",
      "source_sha256": "0489af1e27b53f5d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Simon: Do not look at me as insignificant, and do not look down on the simplicity of my words."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s14",
      "source_sha256": "142343ec70a9e783",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Look at the signs of the one who sent me, which condemn your teaching. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s15",
      "source_sha256": "44fbfa3e5e600b9f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Go away, old man! You are greatly mistaken. Leave our city, to which you have come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s16",
      "source_sha256": "7a65f1354b277b14",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Who sent you to come here—the one you rely on and boast about? Simon:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.3.s17",
      "source_sha256": "457fee58e98671eb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The time for me to leave has not yet come, until I have cultivated your city and uprooted the thorns within it,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s1",
      "source_sha256": "c63205f56c953432",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and sown my Lord’s seed within it. Nero: Look, old man, you are greatly mistaken, for you have called Zeus and his companions thorns."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s2",
      "source_sha256": "3b7672cf98155967",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On whom do you rely, that you insult the gods of great Rome? Simon:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s3",
      "source_sha256": "a965cd488282f1b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "See, O king, how despised I am: even my words are unwelcome to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s4",
      "source_sha256": "c2d5cfd8b4bba221",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For we who are despised before your throne, through the signs that are seen [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0aec7959c0fd5c8b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero: I have heard the report that the people of Jerusalem hung that Lord of yours on a tree."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s6",
      "source_sha256": "dd434e0c0f67aa7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if it is true, as they say, he was laid in a tomb like everyone else."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s7",
      "source_sha256": "da3d2cabd0e7f39c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Simon: The report you have heard is true: he was laid in a tomb like everyone else."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s8",
      "source_sha256": "3040c662932bc866",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he rose from the tomb unharmed, and ascended to the highest heavens and took his seat."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s9",
      "source_sha256": "b029527ca5d92907",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero: I offer you two gifts: death and life, two brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s10",
      "source_sha256": "296772c001af203f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you deny him, gain life; and if you do not deny him, taste death. Peter:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s11",
      "source_sha256": "7a65d05c4eb10ea7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus taught us and told us, “Whoever denies me, I will deny him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s12",
      "source_sha256": "664c74db9ec06fcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And whoever acknowledges me in this world, I will honor him in the kingdom of heaven.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s13",
      "source_sha256": "ba2c3aaf9ed567fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero: Deny the Christ whom you proclaim, and I will honor you in Rome."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s14",
      "source_sha256": "e720cbad2a931bc8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not contend against my kingdom and lead mighty Rome astray."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s15",
      "source_sha256": "a03afb73a3cb23d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Simon: You have clothed yourself in zeal for the king against that King who made me king."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s16",
      "source_sha256": "3304fc34e3bc8e37",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do you not know, wretched man, that the heights and the depths hang upon his command? Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.4.s17",
      "source_sha256": "ef1129b5fbb1d213",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Did not Herod seek to kill him, the one of whom you say, “He made me king”? And if the Egyptians had not sheltered him, he would not have remained"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s1",
      "source_sha256": "7cc711a487ae03b5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in the world. Peter: Have you not heard, Nero, what overtook Herod?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s2",
      "source_sha256": "46cf727aa3d741dd",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Severe and varied torments—and so he departed from the world. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s3",
      "source_sha256": "53e692e0bd7e3839",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What sense is there in our being persuaded by you, accepting your words, and believing you?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s4",
      "source_sha256": "3651da2e26b92bc1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "How can someone who did not save himself give life to others? Peter:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s5",
      "source_sha256": "47303a9246f7dc65",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Death, which ruled over our race—he undid it and abolished it through his resurrection."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s6",
      "source_sha256": "38fb923a0758edd8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He plundered the treasury of Sheol and shut the mouth of the devourer."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s7",
      "source_sha256": "dd3544e062730040",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nero: Let your Lord come and rescue you when I order you to be crucified."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s8",
      "source_sha256": "2c2c31b51e53cd51",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And if he is true, as you say, let everyone know that he has authority over me. Simon:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s9",
      "source_sha256": "34c856ed09509be9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let Pilate arise and refute you, the one in whose court he stood and was tried."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s10",
      "source_sha256": "362cf7335a91350d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he washed his hands of his blood, knowing that he was Lord of all. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s11",
      "source_sha256": "dca0fe7de95d696e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Foolish old man, do you not know that your death and your life lie hidden in my hands? Why have you dared to insult me?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s12",
      "source_sha256": "f538fabce277dd93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do you not know that your end has come? Simon: I am an old man, as you said, and the Lord who chose me sent me"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s13",
      "source_sha256": "a1c0aef6590d7195",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to be a father and instruct everyone, and to turn everyone toward the Lord. Nero:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s14",
      "source_sha256": "9ccd091576ac24a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Is it only to us that you have been sent, or do you preach to all nations? And if it is Rome that you have reached,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s15",
      "source_sha256": "47dab3ac05014a2c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you are not accepted even in Rome. Peter: All the nations that are scattered—twelve men give them counsel."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.5.s16",
      "source_sha256": "f366e8a183b29da8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And Rome fell to me as my allotted portion, from the Holy Spirit who sent me. Nero."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s1",
      "source_sha256": "14050e03a6ed02db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "So Paul, as you said, is with you, preaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s2",
      "source_sha256": "3e2d06d39e705a60",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And has great and mighty Rome fallen to you two alone as your portion? Peter."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s3",
      "source_sha256": "5770b19c015c91a1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Paul has been assigned to the Gentiles alone, to preach, teach, and admonish."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s4",
      "source_sha256": "38c48c2bed8d0b2d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And the Lord has authorized him to convert the nations everywhere. Nero."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s5",
      "source_sha256": "7c6a6015ea0dbfa1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "You were a fisherman, as people say, but you abandoned the fishing you grew up with."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s6",
      "source_sha256": "5702fe0b83688a07",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And you chose another trade, one that destroys your [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s7",
      "source_sha256": "543fd839e551a01c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Simon. Fishing for fish brought me no profit; I have been appointed to catch people."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s8",
      "source_sha256": "0e3504d31b94f39c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And now I catch people so that they may become servants of the one who sent me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s9",
      "source_sha256": "403bc5c5afee3834",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Nero. If you had bowed down for a little while, you could have gone on living in the world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s10",
      "source_sha256": "9af21c22a368df1e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But now that you have acted boldly and have not feared me, your life in this world is coming to an end."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s11",
      "source_sha256": "02ad8f4a393ea366",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Peter. Our Lord warned us beforehand: “Do not be shaken, my friends,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s12",
      "source_sha256": "7b276f9fbb332258",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "by those who kill the body but cannot destroy your souls.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s13",
      "source_sha256": "c4e8bd6bbd468b1e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Nero. Rome has been the capital of our kingdom: [?] every death by which you will die."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s14",
      "source_sha256": "b65c6531ee01b212",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Simon. As you said, mighty Rome is the capital of your kingdom."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s15",
      "source_sha256": "7ee5bebd4d69a99c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I have sown good seed in it. Give me a cross as the reward for my labor. Nero."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s16",
      "source_sha256": "7537aaaf7f62dd70",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "A fine reward you have asked of me—the cross on which your master too was crucified!"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s17",
      "source_sha256": "8ea086b21e2199a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Let my sword be Paul’s reward, and I will honor you with a cross. Simon."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.6.s18",
      "source_sha256": "e2eae42c9ef2d68e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Listen and grant me one request: when my Lord was crucified, his head was upward."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.7.s1",
      "source_sha256": "fe2c835f5420ea5a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Let my head be downward and my feet upward, for I am not worthy to be crucified like my Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.7.s2",
      "source_sha256": "98e905db8db1c0a9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The spectators stood marveling at the courageous and faithful old man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.7.s3",
      "source_sha256": "7f8589ee98efd605",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“Well done, Peter!” the believers cried. “How firm your foundation is!”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.7.s4",
      "source_sha256": "2e114ff8b08b239d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“Let thanks be given to the Good One,” the believers cried, “for your name has been [?] in our dwelling place."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "dsc/disputation-of-peter-and-nero#DSC524.text.7.s5",
      "source_sha256": "ff48179d441ff648",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-28",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And may the bones of your apostles also be advocates for your faithful.”"
    }
  ]
}
